                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/releases/tag/v8.4.1"&gt;8.4.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This release of the .NET Community Toolkit updates the MVVM Toolkit analyzers and source generator to Roslyn 5.0, so they can work with C# 14 out of the box. This means that &lt;code&gt;[ObservableProperty]&lt;/code&gt; on partial properties no longer needs &lt;code&gt;preview&lt;/code&gt; language version 🎉&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed 🆕&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Migrate workflow to GitHub Actions by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Sergio0694/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Sergio0694"&gt;@Sergio0694&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3209758055" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/issues/1105" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/pull/1105/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/pull/1105"&gt;#1105&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove extra dash in &lt;code&gt;--no-build&lt;/code&gt; argument in dotnet test invokation by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/echoix/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/echoix"&gt;@echoix&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3592689347" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/issues/1132" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/pull/1132/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/pull/1132"&gt;#1132&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump unit tests from .NET 7 to .NET 9 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Sergio0694/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Sergio0694"&gt;@Sergio0694&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3078926441" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/issues/1085" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/pull/1085/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet/pull/1085"&gt;#1085&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
